Analysis: Which columns have little impact on retention?
------------------------------------------------------------
The following input columns show the least difference between
the worst-performing employees and the rest of the population.
These are candidates for removal from data collection:
1. EmployeeCount
2. over18
3. PerformanceRating
4. StandardHours
5. MonthlyRate
------------------------------------------------------------
These columns are statistically least relevant to performance.

